    "fourth-question cooperation: shield support leaves the companion at a rear cookie gate, a real player side-plate landing raises it, or the companion takes a visible elevated detour and rejoins later",
    "selected sibling remains controlled throughout; automatic companion support, forward camera space, optional guarded one-shot haptics, and no gameplay text outside story and knowledge questions",
    "retained third-floor 60-second runner, two causal cooperation relays, gummy boost, variable jump, lower fallback route and removed overhead lamp strip",
    "retained first-floor three single-player cooperative puzzles, gifts, physical badge slots, key, exit latch and original ending comics",
    "existing hand-painted candy-house assets, exact filename casing, foot anchors, local light, particles and mechanism sound cues"
